rastically change your character's battle style.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1591220/extras/1ff8e3a4aabb27fdf3c891a8056165d6.poster.avif?t=1721026720\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1591220/extras/1ff8e3a4aabb27fdf3c891a8056165d6.webm?t=1721026720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
